<title>USA: SPX, Hewlett-Packard form alliance.</title>
<headline>SPX, Hewlett-Packard form alliance.</headline>
<dateline>MUSKEGON, Mich. 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>SPX Corp and Hewlett-Packard Co said they have formed a strategic alliance to jointly develop and market universal service solutions for the global motor vehicle service industry.</p>
<p>The alliance will leverage H-P's technology leadership in measurement, communications and computing with SPX's expertise in vehicle diagnostics and strong global distribution of service tools and equipment to the motor vehicle service industry, the companies said.</p>
<p>Products and services developed through the alliance will be targeted to improve productivity and quality of vehicle repair, as well as customer service, at franchised dealerships and aftermarket service facilities.</p>
</text>
